      "title": "Components must come from authorized sources",
      "desc": "A GitLab CI/CD component is included from a source that is not trusted: not on an explicit allowlist, not under the scanned project's own namespace, not on the same GitLab instance (when that trust is enabled), and not one of GitLab's official namespaces on gitlab.com (when that trust is enabled). Components run arbitrary code with the job's full context (variables, secrets, CI_JOB_TOKEN), so an untrusted source increases supply chain attack risk.",
      "types": [
        "CI/CD Security",
        "Supply Chain",
        "Security"
      ],
