    {
      "id": "10c3a6e8-248a-e1bf-f4a8-2e861cfab367",
      "name": "Container image is not pinned by digest",
      "message": "Job `build` uses image `docker.io/node:latest` without a digest.",
      "description": "A container image in the pipeline is not pinned by its SHA256 digest. Without digest pinning, a tag can be reassigned to a different image, introducing supply chain risks.\n\nFinding: Job `build` uses image `docker.io/node:latest` without a digest.\n\nA new version of `docker.io/node:latest` runs inside `build` without any change in this repository, holding secrets Plumber could not list: code runs on an ephemeral runner and nothing else is proven.",
